{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>此前，據媒體報道，小米汽車首款增程式SUV將歸屬全新獨立子品牌「SkyNomad」，該車將不再使用小米主品牌標識，計劃於2026年下半年正式發佈。</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/286/w550h1336/20260708/99d3-213fd6eeab77e3ed4c91233910b4d9ad.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-08T00:18:02.660414+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}